he AI Era","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-java-users-group/events/316707940/","description":"**Note special location: Intuit, 8 Spadina Ave, 19th Floor**\n\n**7 Ways You Can Build an Amazing Dev Career in the AI Era**\n\nAre you also wondering where you fit in all of this?\n\nEvery day, you are bombarded with claims that AI will transform software development. Is this an unprecedented opportunity or an existential threat?\n\nAfter more than 30 years in the software industry, I've seen technologies create opportunities, destroy opportunities, and completely reshape careers.\n\nYet... there are always professionals who seem to thrive regardless of the changes happening around them.\n\nWhy do some become more valuable... while others struggle?\n\nThis presentation will face the myths around AI head-on and explore how you can create opportunities in the age of AI... instead of being afraid and scrambling to keep up.\n\nBecause the future may belong to those who understand something deeper than technology itself...\n\n**About the venue**\nIntuit has generously offered to host Toronto JUG in their downtown office at The Well. They will provide some food and drinks.\n\n**Speaker Bio**\nSince 1995, Bruno has been helping Java developers advance their careers and work on exciting projects. A recognized Java Evangelist and Java Champion, as well as a board member of the Java Community Process, Bruno founded and leads SouJava, the Brazilian Java Users Society. In his book, \"Developer Career Masterplan,\" Bruno shares insights on career development for senior developers, topics he further explores in his Code4.life project.","startDate":"2026-10-13T22:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-3-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Intuit","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"8 Spadina Ave. Suite 1900, Toronto, ON M5V 0S8, Canada, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Toronto Java Users Group","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-java-users-group/"},"performer":"Toronto Java Users Group"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Silent Bookclub Meeting #96","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-silent-book-club-meetup-group/events/316788847/","description":"The next event is happening on Tuesday October 13, starting at 6PM in the Wellington Market Food Hall at The Well!\n\nWe'll be meeting in front of the Nord Lyon in The Wellington Market (food court!)\n\nPlease RSVP if you're planning on coming so we can plan appropriately!","startDate":"2026-10-13T22:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-4-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"The well","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"486 Front Street West Toronto, ON M5V 0V2 Canada, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Silent Book Club (Toronto)","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-silent-book-club-meetup-group/"},"performer":"Silent Book Club (Toronto)"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Soirée en français au Madison Pub -$3","url":"https://www.meetup.com/frenchmeetup/events/314989506/","description":"Cet événement comporte des frais de 3 $ afin de compenser le coût de l'hébergement sur la plateforme Meetup.\nThis event has a 3$ fee to help offset the cost of hosting on the Meetup platform.\n**[PAYER ICI PAY HERE](https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/KSPACXU2YRG66)**\n\nBonjour tout le monde!\nSoyez des nôtres au prochain French meetup au Madison Pub. Venez passer une soirée conviviale et rencontrer des francophones